## Python Instruction
Create a function that takes a 2D array and an integer as arguments and returns the 2D array after rotating it clockwise by the given number of times.

## Python Solution
```python
def rotate_2D_array(arr, n):
    for _ in range(n):
        arr = list(zip(*arr[::-1]))
    return [list(i) for i in arr]
```

## Python Tests
